# EIF example only — choose according to project sensitivity/audit requirements.
# Durable verified state is often committed. Transient artifacts may be local.

# Common transient choices:
.eif/HANDOFF.md
.eif/ESCALATION.md
.eif/EMERGENCY_RECORD.md

# Optional: keep discovery reports local if they may contain sensitive topology.
# .eif/DISCOVERY_REPORT.md

# Runtime policy may expose policy shape/allowlists; decide per repository.
# .cursor/eif-runtime-policy.json

# Never use .gitignore as the only secret-control mechanism.
